<title>ESTONIA: NORMA FIVE MONTH PROFIT 52.3 MILLION KROONS.</title>
<headline>NORMA FIVE MONTH PROFIT 52.3 MILLION KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified industralist Norma said on Monday that its profit in the first five months of 1997 was 52.3 million kroons.  </p>
<p>The company also said in a brief statement that its turnover for the first five months of 1997 was 198.1 million kroons.</p>
<p>The company added that its results were influenced by growth in its eastern markets and the improvement in its clients' financial situation.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
